(EVID/'README.md').write_text('''# Female reference outfit candidate v1\n\nThis package records four independent candidate slots from the saved turnaround reference. It reuses immutable female source assets and records material intent without emitting recolored runtime GLBs. The package is not runtime-accepted or visual-accepted.\n\n- Inner top uses the admitted 1K female uniform-top fit as a cream material candidate.\n- Outer uses the static female vest-layer source as a lavender material candidate. It is not a verified knit cardigan and exceeds the m2 technical texture budget at 2K.\n- Pants uses the exact female training-pants source only as a taupe fallback. It ends at the knee, so the ankle-length straight-trouser requirement remains open.\n- Shoes uses the exact female uniform-shoes source only as a beige fallback. It is flat, so the low-heel requirement remains open.\n\nAll per-slot recipe, manifest, fit, coverage, source-lock and license data are under `assets-source/female-reference-outfit-v1/<slot>/`.\n''',encoding='utf-8')
